      "solution": {
        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "P(Y=2)=2/9+1/3=5/9, so the conditional probabilities for X=5 and X=10 are 2/5 and 3/5. Thus Var[X|Y=2]=(5-8)^2(2/5)+(10-8)^2(3/5)=6, option d. The mathematical answer is determined; Math Academy's key is unavailable because no answer or grade was supplied.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
