        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "Conditioning on Y=\\pi/3 makes X<Y equivalent to X<\\pi/3. Thus the probability is \\int_0^{\\pi/3}\\sin x\\,dx=1-\\cos(\\pi/3)=1/2, option d. No captured Math Academy answer or grade confirms its key.",
        "confidence": 1,
