        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "The velocity is r'(t)=⟨t\\cos t,-t\\sin t⟩, with speed t since t>0. Thus the unit tangent is T(t)=⟨\\cos t,-\\sin t⟩ and ||T'(t)||=1. Curvature is ||T'(t)||/||r'(t)||=1/t, option d. No captured Math Academy answer or grade confirms its key.",
