      "solution": {
        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "Streamlines satisfy dy/dx=(-2y)/(2x)=-y/x, giving xy=C. These are rectangular hyperbolas with the coordinate axes as asymptotes, matching option a. The axis rays are also streamlines, and the origin is an equilibrium. No captured Math Academy answer or grade confirms its key.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "correct_value": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14111253/assets/3a3ef451c7e25ff33fb1820d5b8c98e10038c4ee058f627d93acf72989b7b794.png",
            "correct_option": "a",
