      "solution": {
        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "For an orthogonal basis, the projection is the sum of the individual projections. The t component is 15t. The t² coefficient is ⟨g,t²⟩/⟨t²,t²⟩=[∫₋₁¹(15t³+3t²)dt]/[∫₋₁¹t⁴dt]=2/(2/5)=5. Thus the projection is 15t+5t², option e. No captured Math Academy answer or grade confirms its key.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "correct_value": "15t+5{t}^{2}",
            "correct_option": "e",
            "value_type": "math",
            "wrong_value": "15t+3{t}^{2}",
            "correct_keys": [],
            "wrong_keys": [],
