      "solution": {
        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "Two steps from x=0 to x=2 give h=1. The implicit trapezoidal formula is y_{n+1}=y_n+(h/2)[f(x_n,y_n)+f(x_{n+1},y_{n+1})]. Thus y_1=(1+y_1)/2, giving y_1=1. Next, y_2=1+[(1+1)+(2+y_2)]/2, giving y_2=6. Rounded values are 1.00 and 6.00. No captured Math Academy answer or grade establishes its key.",
        "confidence": 1,
        "answers": [
