        "topic_match": {
          "topic_id": "4146",
          "confidence": 0.99,
          "reasoning": "The question tests evaluating a triple integral over a Type I region, with 0≤x≤1, 0≤y≤2, and 0≤z≤3−2x. This directly matches Triple Integrals Over Type I Regions."
