mi></mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>0.3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the smallest sample size is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"426\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>101.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
