      "solution": {
        "status": "unavailable",
        "reasoning": "The region is 0≤z≤π/4, 0≤y≤π/4, and 0≤x≤tan(y). Since tan is increasing here, reversing the x,y order gives 0≤x≤1 and arctan(x)≤y≤π/4. Thus the requested order is exactly option e. No captured Math Academy answer or grade establishes its key.",
